          m_StringArgument: Attack by hitting the assigned "Attack" button. The attack
            used changes depending on directional input.<br><br>An attack's hitbox
            is active when the blade turns red. If this red blade hits an opponent
            who isn't blocking, they'll be hit.<br><br>Most attacks will deal damage,
            knockback, and stun. Damage is taken directly from the opponent's health,
            Knockback sends the enemy at a certain angle and strength, and Stun prevents
            the opponent from acting for a certain period of time.
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
