          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: The Stamina bar displays a player's ability to block.<br><br>The
            Stamina bar starts at 100 points, and drains by 30 points per second
            while blocking. Successfully blocking an attack reduces the bar by 50
            points.<br><br>If the bar runs out from overruse, it takes 2.5 seconds
            to start recharging. If it runs out from being hit, it takes 5 seconds
            to start recharging.<br><br>Stamina recharges at a rate of 10 points
            per second while not in use, and is restored fully upon consuming Adrenaline.<br><br>While
            Stamina is 0, a player is unable to block.
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
