        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: To perform a footstool, jump on an opponent's head. This
            cannot be done while the opponent is stunned or blocking.<br><br>Footstooling
            applies 2 seconds of hitstun to the opponent.<br><br>Landing on an opponent's
            head without attempting to jump or while the opponent is stunned or blocking
            will result in a slip.<br><br>Slipping results in 2 seconds of hitstun
            being applied to the slipping player, who then bounces off the opponent's
            head away from them.
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
